# Build context of the app image (see Dockerfile). The image needs only
# package.json, package-lock.json, src/, and the web/ sources; everything else
# stays out, and secrets or local state must never reach the builder.

# Secrets and local state (`.cache` holds the dev Access signing key).
**/.env*
**/.dev.vars
**/.cache
.claude

# Dependencies and build output are installed and built inside the image.
**/node_modules
web/dist

# Not part of the runtime image.
.git
plans
tests
docs
streams.config.json
repomix-output.*
test-results
playwright-report
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
